sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant GateEE as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01)
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (eu-yy01)
    participant Platform as Platform (plt-xxx-001)

    Authority->>+GateEE: GET /v1/dataset/eu-yy01/plt-xxx-001/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890?subsetId=EU07
    Note over Authority,GateEE: Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>(is_authority / is_admin)<br/>X-Request-ID echoed.

    GateEE->>GateEE: Validate JWT + authorize (require is_admin OR is_authority)
    GateEE->>GateEE: Forward to remote gate eu-yy01

    GateEE->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4: UILQueryRequest<br/>(subsetId=EU07, requestId=req-e5f6a7b8)

    GateFI->>+Platform: GET /v1/datasets/a1b2c3d4-...?subsetId=EU07

    alt Platform denies access (403)
        Platform-->>GateFI: 403 Forbidden (RFC 7807)
        GateFI-->>GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=403, code=FORBIDDEN_SUBSET}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 403 Forbidden (application/problem+json)<br/>{ "type":"https://api.efti.ee/errors/forbidden-subset",<br/>  "code":"FORBIDDEN_SUBSET",<br/>  "title":"Forbidden",<br/>  "status":403,<br/>  "detail":"Authority is not permitted to access subset EU07 on this dataset",<br/>  "instance":"/v1/dataset/eu-yy01/plt-xxx-001/a1b2c3d4-..." }

    else Platform dataset not found (404)
        Platform-->>GateFI: 404 Not Found (RFC 7807)
        GateFI-->>GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=404, code=CONSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 404 Not Found (application/problem+json)<br/>{ "type":"https://api.efti.ee/errors/consignment-not-found",<br/>  "code":"CONSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND",<br/>  "title":"Not Found",<br/>  "status":404,<br/>  "detail":"Dataset not found or expired",<br/>  "instance":"/v1/dataset/eu-yy01/plt-xxx-001/a1b2c3d4-..." }

    else Platform unreachable (502)
        Platform-->>-GateFI: Connection timeout / 5xx
        GateFI-->>-GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=502, code=GATEWAY_UNAVAILABLE}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 502 Bad Gateway (application/problem+json)<br/>{ "type":"https://api.efti.ee/errors/gateway-unavailable",<br/>  "code":"GATEWAY_UNAVAILABLE",<br/>  "title":"Bad Gateway",<br/>  "status":502,<br/>  "detail":"Platform plt-xxx-001 unreachable via eu-yy01",<br/>  "instance":"/v1/dataset/eu-yy01/plt-xxx-001/a1b2c3d4-..." }
    end

    GateEE-->>-Authority: Error response
    Note over Authority: Dataset access denied<br/>or unavailable.<br/>Authority may send a<br/>follow-up — see Epic 5.
